    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tongue-Tied Mayhem Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absurd and hilarious co-op platformer, you and a friend take control of two overenthusiastic frogs, permanently stuck together by their stretchy, sticky tongues. Jump, swing, and scream your way through chaotic obstacle courses where coordination, timing, and trust are the only way forward. Will your friendship survive the slime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.poster.avif?t=1753617275\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.webm?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.mp4?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Mode: 2-Player Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with a friend in the core 2-player experience. Each frog moves independently, but your tongues stay fused, meaning every leap, swing, or fall directly affects your partner. Communication and timing are your greatest tools\u2026 or your funniest downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.poster.avif?t=1753617275\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.webm?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.mp4?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4-Player Party Mode: More Frogs, More Fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want even more chaos? Grab three friends and dive into 4-player madness. Team up in pairs or all link together for the ultimate tongue-tangling disaster. This mode is all about laughter, yelling, and blaming each other for falling into the pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.poster.avif?t=1753617275\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.webm?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.mp4?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you and your frog buddy are the fastest pair in the swamp? Compete with players around the world and climb the leaderboards by finishing levels in record time. Only the most coordinated frogs will make it to the top.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tongue-Tied Mayhem Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absurd and hilarious co-op platformer, you and a friend take control of two overenthusiastic frogs, permanently stuck together by their stretchy, sticky tongues. Jump, swing, and scream your way through chaotic obstacle courses where coordination, timing, and trust are the only way forward. Will your friendship survive the slime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.poster.avif?t=1753617275\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.webm?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.mp4?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Mode: 2-Player Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with a friend in the core 2-player experience. Each frog moves independently, but your tongues stay fused, meaning every leap, swing, or fall directly affects your partner. Communication and timing are your greatest tools\u2026 or your funniest downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.poster.avif?t=1753617275\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.webm?t=1753617275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht